Docker-compose files

Dockerfile -> For IACSD

FROM nginx:alpine
LABEL description="IACSD website"
COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html
EXPOSE 80

Dockerfile -> For DITISS

FROM nginx:alpine
LABEL project="DITISS Website"
COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html
EXPOSE 80


Create the Docker Compose file

nano /iacsd-compose-project/compose.yaml

services:
  iacsd:
    build: ./iacsd
    image: hiremath21/iacsd.website:1.0
    container_name: iacsd-web
    expose:
      - "80"
    restart: unless-stopped

  itiss:
    build: ./itiss
    image: hiremath21/itiss.website:1.0
    container_name: itiss-web
    expose:
      - "80"
    restart: unless-stopped

  proxy:
    image: nginx:alpine
    container_name: iacsd-proxy
    ports:
      - "8080:80"
    volumes:
      - ./proxy/default.conf:/etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf:ro
    depends_on:
      - iacsd
      - itiss
    restart: unless-stopped


Step7 -> Configure the nginx reverse proxy

Create the configure file

mkdir -p /iacsd-compose-project/proxy/
nano /iacsd-compose-project/proxy/default.conf

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name _;

    location = /itiss {
        return 301 /itiss/;
    }

    location /itiss/ {
        proxy_pass http://itiss:80/;
    }

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://iacsd:80;
    }
}


Step8 -> Validate and test all three directories

Go to the main directory

cd /iacsd-compose-project

YAML config validation

sudo docker compose config

If no errors:

sudo docker compose down
sudo docker compose up -d --build


Check the containers

sudo docker compose ps


Check the conditions

sudo docker compose ps

Test the websites

curl -I http://localhost:8080/
curl -I http://localhost:8080/itiss/

If error:

sudo docker compose logs

sudo docker compose logs iacsd-proxy

Open in browser:

http://192.168.56.12:8080

